dsh: reasoning:
All good. The final file content:

```
module main


def number(text: str) -> int:
    match int(text):
        case Some(value):
            return value
        case None:
            return 0


def above(a: int, b: int) -> int:
    if a > b:
        return 1
    return 0


def main(args: list[str], out: Stream) -> int:
    out.print(above(number(args[0]), number(args[1])))
    return 0
```

No leftover files created (the heredoc was inline to python3). Done. Total compiler invocations: 6 (one check failing, one check, four runs) + 2 from the script = 8, well under 20.

